<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10344" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">conjŭgālis</span></b> , e,
			adj.
		conjunx, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>relating to marriage, conjugal</i> (prob. not
			ante-Aug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> Prop.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">amor,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. A.
					11, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">licentia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 11, 27</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">di,</span>”
				<i>who preside over marriage</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id. G.
				18</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Sen. Thyest. 1103</span></i>; Aug. Civ. Dei, 6, 9,
			3.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> Esp., <i>faithful</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">CONIVX,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Inscr. Grut. 602, 5</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Inscr. Murat. 1296,
			8</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, of animals: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gregem protegere debent galli,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					8, 2, 11</span></i>
			.—* <i>Adv.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">con-jŭgālĭter</span></b> , <i>as married persons</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vivere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Aug. Ep. 89, 39</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
